# oc-sim scenario v1
# The TONE applet (journal/D-033): open the app menu, move the highlight down
# four times to TONE, launch it, then raise the note by three semitones (C5),
# pick LEVEL and raise it by five steps (1.5 V), go back to NOTE and give it
# CV1 through its submenu (ADD). CV1 adds half a volt: half an octave above
# C5, 739.99 Hz in the title row. The snapshot shows NOTE highlighted with
# +CV1, LEVEL, the empty scroll bar's place, the four waveforms.
ticks 340
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
180 button left down
186 button left up
200 encoder 2 +3
210 encoder 1 +1
220 encoder 2 +5
230 encoder 1 -1
240 button right down
246 button right up
260 encoder 2 +1
270 button right down
276 button right up
290 cv 1 500
